    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Data Analyst. I will give you data scraped from LinkedIn via Apify, which includes a company’s LinkedIn URL. \n\nYour task:\n1. Go to the LinkedIn company page from the provided `companyUrl`.\n2. Find and extract the official company website link listed on that LinkedIn company profile.\n3. Visit that website and scrape or identify the most relevant company contact email (for business or hiring inquiries). \n   - Prefer generic addresses like contact@, info@, hr@, careers@, or any email in the site’s footer or contact page.\n4. Return the results in this structured JSON format:\n\n{\n  \"companyName\": \"{{ $json.company_name }}\",\n  \"companyUrl\": \"{{ $json.company_url }}\",\n  \"companyWebsite\": \"\",\n  \"companyEmail\": \"\"\n}\n\nHere is the LinkedIn company data:\ncompanyName: {{ $json.company_name }}\ncompanyUrl: {{ $json.company_url }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
